SD Mapper V2 browser firmware
=============================

The WebAssembly build embeds `SDM V2 Nextor2.1.1.rom` as the fixed firmware
for its SD Mapper V2 AUX device. The browser interface deliberately offers no
firmware chooser: users configure only SD-card images.

Upstream hardware and firmware project:
https://github.com/fbelavenuto/msxsdmapperv2

Embedded file:

    SDM V2 Nextor2.1.1.rom
    SHA-256 4c5e5a0015d8e4d0b2c837621b2f34a5fd594ee2c449b3af95e40ab6555f8c0d

The image contains the SD Mapper V2 driver and Nextor 2.1.1 components. Refer
to the upstream project and Nextor distribution for their respective source,
copyright, and license notices.
